      ],
      "text": "Configuration variables include PORT (default 3323), required JULES_API_KEY, GITHUB_TOKEN, DATABASE_URL, SLACK_WEBHOOK_URL, LOG_LEVEL, ALLOWED_ORIGINS, and SEMANTIC_MEMORY_URL."
