      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_2b3bd910f872c799dd3b7b977163c8560bc64aaf6f266918eb8d468d6e361974"
      ],
      "text": "A suggested-tasks scanner scans codebases for TODO/FIXME/HACK comments, ranks tasks by priority, and can create Jules sessions to fix the suggested tasks."
